@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy & terms";
}
<div class="panel my-4" style="max-width: 820px">
    <h1 class="h3">Privacy &amp; terms</h1>
    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Your data</h2>
    <p>We store the details you give us to run your account and deliver orders: your name, email, shipping address and order history. You can download or delete your personal data from <a asp-area="Identity" asp-page="/Account/Manage/Index">Account settings</a>.</p>
    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Payments</h2>
    <p>This is a demo store. Checkout records your order but does not take a real payment.</p>
    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Seller terms</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>You must own or have licensed the rights to everything you sell, and describe it accurately.</li>
        <li>You ship physical orders and perform booked services promptly, and mark them fulfilled in Seller Central.</li>
        <li>Sellers keep the share of each sale shown in Seller Central (royalties for ebooks).</li>
        <li>Listings that break the marketplace guidelines can be taken down by the store team.</li>
        <li>Customers keep access to downloads they bought even if the listing is later unpublished.</li>
    </ul>
</div>
